{
 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "b262f5a5-f6db-4d41-871a-b477efa73071",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "XPATH"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "4de48755-0a69-43be-b328-0d4b9f34a85e",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "http://www.w3school.com.cn/xpath/index.asp"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "b51dbb11-bac4-40ee-a998-7bdf886b9533",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "XPath 是一门在 XML 文档中查找信息的语言。XPath 可用来在 XML 文档中对元素和属性进行遍历。\n",
    "XPath 使用路径表达式在 XML 文档中进行导航。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "3a4b2b49-a912-4f5b-95ae-6fbd491c7370",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "(1)XPath节点"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "3eb9b20c-748c-4469-802b-a93538e0c223",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "1)节点术语(node)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "8426005a-442e-4369-b124-3eadd5fe425e",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "在XPath中，有七种类型的节点: 元素、属性、文本、命名空间、处理指令、注释以及文档节点(或称为根节点)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "f5d79cd0-3a94-43a5-b8a7-f9a56f0a94a8",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"IS0-8859-1\"?>\n",
    "<bookstore>\n",
    "<book>\n",
    "    <title lang=\"en\">Harry Potter</title>\n",
    "    <author>J K. Rowling</author>\n",
    "    <year>2005</year>\n",
    "    <price>29.99</price>\n",
    "</book>\n",
    "</bookstore>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "dc79ec62-9529-4d77-a016-94210e4ea5ed",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "<bookstore><book>(文档节点)\n",
    "<author>J K. Rowling</author> (元素节点)\n",
    "lang=\"en\" (属性节点)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "a8d0d6a1-3d19-47e2-9c25-fac1de6f9702",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "2)节点关系\n",
    "父 (Parent)\n",
    "子 (Children)\n",
    "同胞 (Sibling)\n",
    "先辈 (Ancestor)\n",
    "后代 (Descendant)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "9cf41df1-2b87-422c-922a-eb5f60ed088c",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "<bookstore>\n",
    "    <book>\n",
    "        <title>Harry Potter</title>\n",
    "        <author>J K. Rowling</author>\n",
    "        <year>2005</year>\n",
    "        <price>29.99</price>\n",
    "    </book>\n",
    "</bookstore>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "d7d4b761-6db6-404d-9bbc-9206db87df52",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "(2)XPath 语法\n",
    "\n",
    "如何定位?\n",
    "XPath使用路径表达式来选取 XML 文档中的节点或节点集。节点是通过沿着路径 (path) 或者步 (steps) 来选取的。\n",
    " 路径可以是绝对的，也可用是相对的。\n",
    " 绝对路径起始于正斜扛(/)，而相对路径不会这样。在两种情况中，位置路径均包括一个或多个步，每个步均被斜扛分割:\n",
    "        绝对位置路径:/step/step/...\n",
    "        相对位置路径:step/step/..."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "a3e3f209-9e0d-42ae-9444-06c850112fc6",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "<bookstore>\n",
    "<book>\n",
    "    <title>Harry Potter</title>\n",
    "    <author>J K. Rowling</author>\n",
    "    <year>2005</year>\n",
    "    <year>2010</year>\n",
    "    <price>29.99</price>\n",
    "</book>\n",
    "</bookstore>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "82cf05c4-b890-4345-9fce-8b3ea4bc8831",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "获取 J K.Rowling 的值的路径是 /bookstore/book/author, //author\n",
    "获取2010的值 /bookstore/book/year[2], //book/year[2]"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "a4a4f8b0-76e3-4f02-985d-a6420d2fa2ef",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "如何提取数据\n",
    "\n",
    "'''\n",
    " <a href=\"/news/view?id=9283&cid=12\" title=\"防灾减灾救灾，习近平强调这几个要点\"  target=\"_blank\" class=\"okmemo-tmp-unselect\"> 防灾减灾救灾，习近平强调这几个要点</a>\n",
    "'''\n",
    "\n",
    "提取元数据 a/text() a/@title --> 防灾减灾救灾，习近平强调这几个要点\n",
    "提取属性信息 a/@href --> /news/view?id=9283&cid=12"
   ]
  },
